# EV Dashboard & ADAS Warning System: Integration and System Testing

Final internship task: integration of UART, I2C, SPI, ADC and ADAS modules
into one STM32F103 firmware, with a full test campaign.

**Report:** [report/EV_ADAS_Integration_Test_Report.pdf](report/EV_ADAS_Integration_Test_Report.pdf)

## Results
- 49 automated tests (22 unit, 14 integration, 13 system): all pass
- Alert latency: 120 ms worst case (limit 250 ms)
- 10-minute soak: 0 deadline misses, 0 dropped frames

## Run the tests
    make VARIANT=final run

Requires GCC and make. Results are written to `out/results_final.csv`.

## Folder layout
- `src/`, `include/`: firmware
- `port/hal_sim.c`: simulated hardware (software-in-the-loop)
- `tests/`: unit, integration and system tests

